        "description": "Alza (alza.cz, Czech Republic) product search, 24 a page: product id and order code, link, name, short specification, price and original price (CZK), price label (e.g. a sale), rating and rating count, availability, buyable flag, number of variants, icons (best-seller rank, energy class, discount...) and image, plus the listing's title, total and price range. Alza often answers a search with a category listing (e.g. 'iphone' opens the iPhone category). Pass `next_cursor` back as `cursor`; null on the last page.\n\nEvery response includes `credits_used`: the credits this call cost.\n\nPrice: 1 credit per successful call. Docs: https://api.sh/docs/alza-search",
